@dialect harness-seq/1
@seq 1
@entry SECURITY_BIND
⊢ loaded_only_from_change.seq_POST_VERIFY_after_all_workers_complete_and_Main_integrates_actual_final_diff; no_replacement_main
⊢ security_review_required := security_sensitive ∨ explicit_security_review_request
⊢ Main_owns_all_dispatch/correction/retry_decisions; Attacker_and_verifier-blackhat_are_read_only_leaf_roles; no_child_delegation
⊢ inherit_etl/main.seq_retry(gate,ADV∨DENY)<=3_and_shared_correction_cycles<=3_across_proposal/design/implementation_reviews; no_new_budget_or_counter_reset
⊢ all_Attacker_routes/aliases_and_hard_Astra_reasoning_insufficiency_gate_unchanged; verification_gate=../agents/blackhat.md

🔒 SECURITY_BIND @main
FinalIntegratedDiff → SecurityIdentity(exact_target; immutable_revision_or_content_digest_manifest; bounded_scope; acceptance/specification; supported_lenses; shared_cycle_count)
⊢ bind_reports_and_discovery_checkpoint_to_same_identity; no_uncommitted_HEAD_only_identity_when_contents_differ; changes_invalidate_affected_reviews
¬security_review_required ⇒ return(change.seq,FINAL_VERIFY)
security_review_required ∧ (¬task_authorized ∨ ¬agent.mode_permits_independent_review ∨ ¬actual_Attacker_or_Verifier_runtime_support) ⇒ Evidence(security=FAILED/INCOMPLETE; missing_independent_assessment; separately_labeled_Main_check_is_not_role_execution_or_security_PASS) → FINISH(task=FAILED)
security_review_required ∧ eligible_actual_runtime ⇒ SECURITY_ATTACKER

🛡 SECURITY_ATTACKER @main
⊢ Main_selects_eligible_attacker-low_or_attacker-medium_by_bounded_question_under_../agents/SUBAGENTS.lrf; no_automatic_tier_upgrade
⊢ completed_actual_attacker-medium_exact_ESCALATE_may_only_enter_existing_subagent.attacker-routing_hard_gate_by_explicit_Main_choice_after_full_correlated_report_review_and_same-target/revision/lens/scope_one-shot_approval; retain_source_report_ID/model/structured_reasoning_insufficiency_evidence; collect_actual_result_before_continuing; no_automatic_Astra_or_new_escalation_route
⊢ retain_required_independent_supported_lenses_and_wait-all/correlate/synthesize; >=2_genuinely_independent_artifact_supported_lenses_when_useful_else_one_question; exact_unchanged_revision/scope/lens_reuse_only
⊢ Main_handoff_Acceptance_adds_AttemptLedger_to_existing_blackhat.md_output; no_change_to_existing_RTS_STATUS/RTS_ESCALATION_schemas_or_tier_mapping
SecurityIdentity → Attacker(read_only_analysis_by_default) → ActualAttackerReports
AttemptLedger := [{attempt_id; vector_or_action; lens; exact_target/revision/surface; assumptions_preconditions_or_explicit_none; source_evidence(path+line/diff_hunk_or_artifact_section); mode=analysis-only|executed; executed=true|false; bounded_analysis_or_exact_command/action; expected_signal; observed_outcome; outcome_evidence; limitations}]
⊢ analytical_vector_attempt⇒mode=analysis-only_and_executed=false; hypothetical_outcome_labeled_inference; no_tested/exploited/safe_claim_without_actual_evidence; no_attempts⇒empty_ledger_with_explicit_coverage_limitation
⊢ executed=true_requires_actual_action_evidence/exit_code/observed_signal; any_exploit_or_reproduction_requires_numbered_annotation→actual_correlated_Researcher_triage→explicit_post-triage_parent_proceed_for_exact_target/revision/commands/effects_under_blackhat.md; changed_scope/revision/actions/effects⇒re-gate; missing_or_INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE_triage⇒stop/no_reproduction; no_Main-only_Researcher_substitute
⊢ routine_review_never_auto-executes_exploits; static/test_label_never_bypasses_reproduction_gate; respect_stricter_read-only_runtime; no_credentials/exfiltration/persistence/destructive_effects/unauthorized_escalation/uncontrolled_propagation; no_CVE/zero-day_guarantee
⊢ every_report_includes_actual_invocation_id/assessor_and_correlated_effective_profile/model_evidence; reported_execution≠verified_execution
⊢ Main_waits_for_all_reports_and_preserves_complete_results_but_WITHHOLDS_reports/finding_summaries/worker_narratives_from_verifier_until_DISCOVERY_COMPLETE
ActualAttackerReports → SECURITY_DISCOVERY

🔍 SECURITY_DISCOVERY @main
⊢ select_distinct_verifier-blackhat_under_existing_Verifier_policy(Terra_high_routinely; Sol_xhigh_for_high-risk/security/repeated_rejection); actual_runtime/profile/model_evidence_required; never_infer_registration
⊢ same_specialized_Verifier_role_is_neither_implementation_author_nor_any_Attacker_assessor; protocol=../agents/verifier-blackhat.md; config=../agents/verifier-blackhat.toml
SecurityIdentity_and_source/specification_WITHOUT_Attacker_reports_or_summaries → verifier-blackhat(independently_inspect_actual_final_diff/snapshot; record_invariants/boundaries/negative_questions/source_evidence) → DISCOVERY_COMPLETE(checkpoint; target/revision/digests; independent_coverage; gaps; limitations)
missing_checkpoint ∨ premature_report_exposure ∨ identity_drift ∨ operational_block ⇒ Evidence(security=INCOMPLETE; never_PASS) → SECURITY_DECIDE
DISCOVERY_COMPLETE ∧ Main_verifies_checkpoint_identity ⇒ SECURITY_AUDIT

🧐 SECURITY_AUDIT @main
⊢ only_after_checkpoint_Main_releases_actual_complete_correlated_reports_and_gate/execution_evidence_to_same_verifier-blackhat; verifier_rechecks_unchanged_revision/digests_before_reading
Checkpoint + ActualAttackerReports → verifier-blackhat(audit_final_security_diff_AND_report_coverage/claims/gates; compare_independent_discovery_to_AttemptLedger; evidence_backed_gaps_and_exact_missed_coverage) → SecurityVerdict(PASS|RETRY_REQUIRED|REJECT|INCOMPLETE)
⊢ RETRY_REQUIRED_may_recommend_only_eligible_attacker-low_or_attacker-medium_with_exact_missed_paths/vectors/preconditions/source_evidence/expected_evidence_and_rationale; advice_only; no_verifier_dispatch_or_retry_ownership
⊢ hard/Astra_never_coverage_retry; only_unchanged_subagent.attacker-routing_completed_verified_Sol_attacker-medium_exact_ESCALATE_reasoning_insufficiency_with_full_evidence_and_explicit_parent_same-scope_one-shot_approval; no_operational_failure_fallback
SecurityVerdict → SECURITY_DECIDE

⚖ SECURITY_DECIDE @main
⊢ Main_inspects_actual_complete_Attacker_and_Verifier_results_and_evidence; RTS_STATUS_SUCCESS_alone≠security_PASS; Attacker_NO_FINDINGS_alone≠security_PASS
PASS ∧ exact_identity_current ∧ adequate_bounded_coverage ∧ no_unresolved_material_findings ⇒ return(change.seq,FINAL_VERIFY)
RETRY_REQUIRED ∨ REJECT ∨ INCOMPLETE ∨ material_Attacker_findings ⇒ Main_decision(retry_bounded_analysis|approved_CODE_correction|stop); never_automatic_advance_or_dispatch
Main_chooses_retry ∧ remaining_shared_retry_budget ∧ no_operational/auth/policy/approval/credential/permission_block ⇒ consume_existing_main.seq_ADV/DENY_retry_and_shared_correction_cycle → SECURITY_BIND ↺
⊢ Main_retry_handoff_names_exact_missed_coverage_and_eligible_low/medium_profile; preserve_previous_reports_and_unchanged_identity_evidence; fresh_Verifier_discovery_must_be_blind_to_reports; do_not_reuse_report-exposed_Verifier_as_fresh_blind_discovery
Main_chooses_CODE_correction ∧ approved_bounded_scope/effects ∧ remaining_shared_retry_budget ⇒ consume_existing_main.seq_ADV/DENY_retry_and_shared_correction_cycle → return(change.seq,CODE); reintegrate_final_diff_then_repeat_affected_security_review
Main_chooses_stop ∨ retry_exhausted ∨ unresolved_material_findings_without_approved_remaining_correction ∨ blocked_required_evidence/runtime ⇒ Evidence(security=FAILED; latest_findings_and_limitations) → FINISH(task=FAILED)
⊢ no_fallthrough_to_PASS_or_FINAL_VERIFY_from_non-PASS; no_counter_reset_after_revision_or_tier_change
